    .. math::

       \begin{align}
       \text{lower} &= \begin{bmatrix} 0 & 0 & 0 & t^{0}_{10} & t^{1}_{10} & t^{1}_{10} & t^{0}_{21} & t^{1}_{21} & t^{2}_{21} \end{bmatrix} \\
